note.p:
The General Committee, consisting of representatives of all delegations,
                    unanimously adopted five draft resolutions recommended by Working Group I. The
                    draft resolutions were on Strengthening Peace and Perfecting American Security;
                    Nonintervention; Study by Inter-American Juridical Committee on Nonintervention;
                    and two resolutions on the Inter-American Peace Committee. (Documents 73–76 and 82 of the Fifth Meeting of Consultation of Ministers of Foreign
                    Affairs; Department of State, Conference Files: Lot 64 D 560, CF 1423)
